# Data Layer Rules

- Normalize API responses.
- Separate DTOs from domain models.
- Validate all inputs and outputs.
- Introduce typed API clients.
- Ensure predictable error handling.
- Reference memorybank for previous API/data layer issues.
- Log new drift and generate follow-up tasks in memorybank.
